          "elements": [
            {
              "id": "text_V4aWj0Ia",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 60,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 76,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:36px;\"><strong>Python 基本语法预览</strong></p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#1a1a1a",
              "rotate": 0
            },
            {
              "id": "text_jzVZu2ru",
              "type": "text",
              "left": 60,
              "top": 176,
              "width": 880,
              "height": 238,
              "content": "<p style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>变量声明</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">变量无需类型声明，直接赋值，如 name = 'Alice'</p><p style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>常用数据类型</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">数字 (int/float)、字符串 (str)、布尔值 (bool)</p><p style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>注释</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">单行注释使用 #，多行注释使用三个引号</p><p style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>代码块</strong></p><p style=\"font-size:16px;\">通过缩进区分代码块，不使用大括号</p>",
              "defaultFontName": "Microsoft YaHei",
              "defaultColor": "#333333",
              "rotate": 0
            }
          ],
          "background": {
            "type": "solid",
            "color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "id": "action_8UweSg-9",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_V4aWj0Ia"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_ex2xGy-G",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "我们来看一下 Python 的基本语法预览。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_X61ZnI5L",
          "type": "spotlight",
          "elementId": "text_jzVZu2ru"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_RewDXTXj",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "首先，变量。Python 的变量不需要声明类型，直接赋值即可，比如 name = 'Alice'。Python 会根据值自动判断类型。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_GOIfKP02",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_jzVZu2ru"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_nySmtYPW",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "常用的数据类型包括数字，也就是 int 和 float，还有字符串 str，以及布尔值 bool。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_wtbThZT5",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_jzVZu2ru"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_BZmOKocN",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "注释方面，单行注释用井号，多行注释用三个引号括起来。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_RH_19Dqv",
          "type": "laser",
          "elementId": "text_jzVZu2ru"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_vBWNfpBr",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "另外，代码块是通过缩进来区分的，不需要使用花括号。缩进的空格数必须保持一致。"
        },
        {
          "id": "action_j8-cOYYd",
          "type": "speech",
          "text": "这就是 Python 语法的几个基础要点，接下来我们会详细展开每个部分。"
        }
      ],
      "createdAt": 1780752374369,
      "updatedAt": 1780752374369
